<title>USA: American Banknote gets USDA coupon renewal.</title>
<headline>American Banknote gets USDA coupon renewal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Banknote Corp, a maker of secure transaction documents and systems, said the Food and Nutrition Service division of the U.S. Department of Agriculture renewed a food coupon printing contract.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the contract, which begins on Oct 1 and runds through Sept 31, 1998 is expected to bring revenues worth approximately $14-17 million.</p>
</text>
